Task 4: hardening | Configure SELinux / AppArmor
Description Task 4: Configure SELinux and AppArmor for security hardening. This includes enabling SELinux, installing required SELinux policies, and enforcing AppArmor profiles for Vault. Use the vault_hardening_configure_selinux_apparmor variable to control this functionality.


