e \'yum_repository\', so update to \'ansible.builtin.yum_repository\'.\n5. **Configure containerd on RHEL 8**: The block inside uses \'yum\' again, so each \'yum\' task needs to be updated to their FQCN.\n\nI should also check if any parameters need adjustment. For example, in the \'file\' task, changing \'content\' to \'remote_src: yes\' should fix that warning.\n\nFinally, ensure that all \'when\' conditions and variables are preserved as per the original playbook. Only the necessary changes to fix linting issues are made without altering the task logic.\n\nAfter making these changes, the playbook should pass ansible-lint without changing its functional behavior.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Remove old Docker versions\n  ansible.builtin.yum:\n    name: "{{ docker_obsolete_packages }}"\n    state: absent\n\n- name: Add Docker GPG key\n  ansible.builtin.yum_key:\n    key: "{{ docker_yum_gpg_key }}"\n    state: present\n  when: docker_add_repo\n\n- name: Add Docker repository\n  ansible.builtin.file:\n    path: /etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo\n    remote_src: yes\n    src: "{{ docker_yum_repo_url }}"\n    owner: root\n    group: root\n    mode: 420\n  when: docker_add_repo\n\n- name: Configure Docker Nightly repo\n  ansible.builtin.yum_repository:\n    name: /etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo\n    state: "{{ \'enabled\' if docker_yum_repo_enable_nightly else \'disabled\' }}"\n  when: docker_add_repo\n\n- name: Configure Docker Test repo\n  ansible.builtin.yum_repository:\n    name: /etc/yum.repos.d/docker-{{ docker_edition }}.repo\n    state: "{{ \'enabled\' if docker_yum_repo_enable_test else \'disabled\' }}"\n  when: docker_add_repo\n\n- name: Configure containerd on RHEL 8\n  block:\n    - name: Remove runc package\n      ansible.builtin.yum:\n        name: runc\n        state: absent\n      when: ansible_facts.distribution_major_version == 8\n\n    - name: Ensure container-selinux is installed\n      ansible.builtin.yum:\n  