de any playbook-level headers like hosts or vars.\n\nPutting it all together, I\'ll structure the YAML with the correct keys: name, tags, changed_when, and the specific modules with their arguments. I\'ll ensure that variables are correctly referenced and that conditions are properly written using the when clause.\n\nI should also check that the tags are correctly applied as molecule-notest to both tasks, as specified. No additional tags or changes should be made.\n\nFinally, I\'ll review the YAML to make sure it\'s valid and adheres to the specified standards, ensuring that it can be included in an Ansible Role without any issues.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Check Python3 version on Debian12\n  command: python3 --version\n  register: py3ver\n  changed_when: false\n  tags:\n    - molecule-notest\n\n- name: Remove EXTERNALLY-MANAGED file on Debian12\n  file:\n    path: /usr/lib/python3.11/EXTERNALLY-MANAGED\n    state: absent\n  when:\n    - py3ver is defined\n    - "\'3.11\' in py3ver.stdout"\n  tags:\n    - molecule-notest\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-04T13:21:15.977119032Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 11464118541, 'load_duration': 91205723, 'prompt_eval_count': 385, 'prompt_eval_duration': 82189186, 'eval_count': 695, 'eval_duration': 11289241181, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--df8d5301-4d6c-4f0f-81b5-68e70436de28-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 385, 'output_tokens': 695, 'total_tokens': 1080}
