hell: |\n    cat /etc/os-release\n  register: os_release\n  changed_when: false\n\n- name: gather_facts | Set bootstrap facts (I)\n  set_fact:\n    distribution: |\n      "{{ os_release.stdout | regex_replace(\'ID=.*\\"(.*)\\".*\', \'\\\\1\') }}"\n    major_version: |\n      "{{ os_release.stdout | regex_replace(\'VERSION_ID=\\".*?(\\\\d+).*\', \'\\\\1\') }}"\n\n- name: gather_facts | Set bootstrap facts (II)\n  set_fact:\n    os_family: |\n      "(((\'RedHat\' if distribution == \'centos\' or distribution == \'rhel\' else \'Debian\') if distribution else \'unknown\'))"\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-04T13:29:14.759804045Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 99826808485, 'load_duration': 90756691, 'prompt_eval_count': 576, 'prompt_eval_duration': 10690040, 'eval_count': 4355, 'eval_duration': 99723847998, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--298a1257-d566-42e6-b07f-c3d287fcb4f3-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 576, 'output_tokens': 4355, 'total_tokens': 4931} 32%|███▏      | 32/100 [1:08:03<2:25:43, 128.58s/it]
